<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cure Serious Wounds</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 14), Paladin (guild level 40)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cure serious wounds &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cure serious wounds</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Heals more of the target's lost hit points than cure light wounds, for a 
little more mana: the better your divine sphere, the more it heals. It works on 
humanoids and mammals, and always on yourself. You can cast it while fighting, 
and it is also found on scrolls, potions and staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
